# Settings changed remotely: edit this file in GitHub (or ask Claude to) and the server picks
# it up on its next auto-update (~5 min, with a restart). These win over .env.
# Never put keys or tokens here: anything named *KEY*, *TOKEN*, *SECRET* is ignored.
# Settings changed with /set in Discord win over this file (/settings shows where each comes from).
#
# To make these permanent, follow each change-log entry's action in your server's .env:
#   CHANGE = the setting is already in .env: edit that line (don't add a second copy)
#   ADD    = .env doesn't have it yet: add the line
# then delete it here (or ask Claude to). /envchanges in Discord checks your .env and says which.
#
# ---- Change log (newest first): date · CHANGE/ADD · setting · old → new · why ---------------
# 2026-10-25 · TEMPORARY · LINEMAKER_ALT_LINES_UNTIL · (none) → 2026-10-25 23:59 · alt lines past the daily budget until tonight; expires by itself, don't copy to .env
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · ODDS_API_BOOKMAKERS · (none: all US books) → fanduel,draftkings,pinnacle,betmgm,williamhill_us,betrivers,fanatics,bovada,betonlineag,lowvig · adds Pinnacle (sharpest book) to the fair price, same credits as the US region (10 books = 1 region). If your .env already has this line, CHANGE it instead
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_ODDS_MIN · (none) → -150 · live parlay legs no longer than -150
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_ODDS_MAX · (none) → -450 · live parlay legs no heavier than -450
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_MIN_PROB · (none) → 0.72 · live parlay legs need a 72%+ hit chance
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_PARLAY_LEGS · (none) → 3 · live auto-parlays 2-3 legs max
# 2026-10-24 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_PLAYS_CACHE_MINUTES · 30 → 10 · fresher prices on every ask (credits to spare)
# 2026-10-24 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_PRETIP_SPORTS · NBA,NFL,NHL → NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB · MLB pre-game + closing reads (lineups, starters)
# 2026-10-24 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_SPORTS · NBA,NFL,NHL → NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB · MLB pitcher-change alerts, daily MLB game-line tracking
#
# ---- Active settings (one per line) -------------------------------------------------------
LINEMAKER_SPORTS=NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB
LINEMAKER_PLAYS_CACHE_MINUTES=10
LINEMAKER_PRETIP_SPORTS=NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB
LINEMAKER_LIVE_ODDS_MIN=-150
LINEMAKER_LIVE_ODDS_MAX=-450
LINEMAKER_LIVE_MIN_PROB=0.72
LINEMAKER_LIVE_PARLAY_LEGS=3
ODDS_API_BOOKMAKERS=fanduel,draftkings,pinnacle,betmgm,williamhill_us,betrivers,fanatics,bovada,betonlineag,lowvig
LINEMAKER_ALT_LINES_UNTIL=2026-10-25 23:59
